{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.poster.avif?t=1773032477\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.webm?t=1773032477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.mp4?t=1773032477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love note to old mazing TDs, Gattai TD forces you to adapt how and what you build each time you play. Start with a small defense that you must grow into a larger more powerful one.\u00a0Each playthrough is a new experience with unique challenges. No single strategy will win every time\u2014you must react wisely to what you are dealt in order to succeed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine colors to form towers!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create towers by combining colored essence in different ways. Plan what towers you choose to merge them into, as different towers excel with different pathing layouts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine towers to form stronger towers!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine towers together with other towers to form unique, more powerful variants. However, be careful, as the more powerful a tower is the more pivotal its position in your defense!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match your towers to\u00a0items of power!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain items that boost individual towers or your entire defense. These relics can result in powerful synergies or wasted potential.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324380?t=1773032477","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324380?t=1773032477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/6b55142f37dcad7370aed6e3f44d33834e4057bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773032477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/6b55142f37dcad7370aed6e3f44d33834e4057bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773032477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.poster.avif?t=1773032477\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.webm?t=1773032477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/extras/649dc3309ccd8cdda0ddfea685011e2c.mp4?t=1773032477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love note to old mazing TDs, Gattai TD forces you to adapt how and what you build each time you play. Start with a small defense that you must grow into a larger more powerful one.\u00a0Each playthrough is a new experience with unique challenges. No single strategy will win every time\u2014you must react wisely to what you are dealt in order to succeed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine colors to form towers!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create towers by combining colored essence in different ways. Plan what towers you choose to merge them into, as different towers excel with different pathing layouts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine towers to form stronger towers!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine towers together with other towers to form unique, more powerful variants. However, be careful, as the more powerful a tower is the more pivotal its position in your defense!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match your towers to\u00a0items of power!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain items that boost individual towers or your entire defense. These relics can result in powerful synergies or wasted potential.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Benign Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324380/3c04e418e732e311e59a08bd3a5b014c8d62b9c2/header.jpg?t=1773032477","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324380/1468280917/3aeef3160443a925e4e1a97ed6ea8f72b49d53cc/1773032194/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773032476","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324380/1468280917/3aeef3160443a925e4e1a97ed6ea8f72b49d53cc/1773032194/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773032476","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324380/1468280917/3aeef3160443a925e4e1a97ed6ea8f72b49d53cc/1773032194/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773032476","id":257300062,"name":"Gattai TD - Playtest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257300062/f737541ccd40b2cd2928279cc884a0239d60b934/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773